## ConversionTagsApi

### Create conversion tag
## Create conversion tag
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_tags
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "aem_db_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_external_id_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_fnln_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_ge_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_loc_enabled": "<string>",
 "aem_ph_enabled": "<string>",
 "md_frequency": "<number>",
 "name": "<string>"
}


### Get conversion tag
## Get conversion tag
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_tags/{{conversion_tag_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List conversion tags
## List conversion tags
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_tags?filterDeleted={{filterDeleted}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Ocpm eligible conversion tags
## Get Ocpm eligible conversion tags
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_tags/ocpm_eligible
Accept: application/json

### Get page visit conversion tags
## Get page visit conversion tags
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/conversion_tags/page_visit?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}
Accept: application/json
